    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRecently refurbished, this attractive 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom semi-detached is presented in excellent, turn-key condition. Situated just off John B. Keane Road, the property enjoys a highly convenient location within walking distance of nearby supermarkets and both primary & secondary schools and a wide range of local amenities.\n\nSet within a quiet and well-maintained development of just 13 homes, the property offers an ideal balance of privacy and convenience, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious lounge/living room, a well-appointed kitchen/dining room, utility room, and guest W.C. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a recently upgraded family bathroom. There is also a stira to a floored attic space with velux window. \n\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, double-glazed uPVC windows throughout, and is connected to all essential mains services.\n\nExternally, the property is approached through a gated entrance with a neatly maintained lawn and mature shrubs to the front. To the rear, a spacious, low-maintenance paved patio provides an ideal outdoor entertaining area, while the fully enclosed rear garden is bounded by masonry walls, offering excellent privacy and security.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained home in a sought-after residential location, close to all the amenities of Listowel.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.57m x 1.95m\nwith wood effect linoleum flooring, understairs storage and airing cupboard\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.57m x 3.72m\nwith electric insert store with marble fireplace, fitted units, wooden effect flooring. French doors lead to the Kitchen / Dining room.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.07m x 3.97m\nwith fitted kitchen, wall tiles, wood effect linoleum flooring, window and sliding patio door to rear garden and patio.\n\nUtility Room - 2.27m x 1.59m\nshelved with countertop, wood effect flooring & window\n\nW/C - 1.58m x 1.58m\nwith whb, w/c, wood effect flooring & window\n\nLanding - 3.81m x 2.15m\nspacious landing with wooden flooring. A stira stairs provides access to the attic which is floored and has the benefit of a velux window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.06m x 3.14m\nDouble with wooden flooring & window\n\nEnsuite - 1.67m x 1.58m\nTriton T90sr electric shower, w/c, whb, wall & floor tiles and window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.09m x 2.71m\nDouble with wooden flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.05m x 2.96m\nSingle with wooden flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.18m x 1.85m\nTriton T90 electric shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nAttic - \nFloored with velux window\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached residence</li><li>Recently refurbished throughout and ready for immediate occupation.</li><li>Ideally located just off John B. Keane Road, within walking distance of Lidl, Aldi, primary and secondary schools, and a host of local amenities.</li><li>Situated in a quiet and well-maintained residential development comprising just 13 homes.</li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation</li><li>The family bathroom has recently been refurbished to a high standard.</li><li>Oil-fired central heating and double-glazed uPVC window</li><li>Connected to all essential mains services.</li><li>Spacious, low-maintenance paved patio to the rear, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining.</li><li>Fully enclosed rear garden with masonry boundary walls, providing excellent privacy and security.</li><li>An ideal home for first-time buyers, families, or those seeking a quality investment property in a convenient residential location.</ul>"
      },
